msgid "Rimuovi emoji scripts"
msgstr "Supprimer les scripts emoji"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:604
msgid ""
"Rimuove wp-emoji-release.min.js e relativi stili inline. I browser moderni "
"supportano emoji nativamente."
msgstr ""
"Supprime wp-emoji-release.min.js et les styles inline associés. Les "
"navigateurs modernes supportent les emoji nativement."

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:613
msgid "Rimuovi Block CSS"
msgstr "Supprimer le CSS Block"

#: includes/class-performance-settings.php:614
msgid ""
"Rimuove wp-block-library-css (~30KB). Attiva solo se non usi blocchi "
"Gutenberg nel frontend."
msgstr ""
"Supprime wp-block-library-css (~30 Ko). Activer uniquement si vous "
"n'utilisez pas de blocs Gutenberg dans le frontend."

